  "demoHmacSecret": "0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef",
  "note": "This demo secret is public and must not be used in production. The proxy hex-decodes HMAC_SECRET to raw bytes before hashing (see config.py), so these digests are reproducible only with that same hex-decoding. Production output depends on the deployment HMAC_SECRET.",
